\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  All who seek baptism
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 do never be so sad
\par Come to the Saviour Lord today
\par and let Him make you clean.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  You who have repented
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 be happy and so glad,
\par that Jesus shall by His own blood
\par will make you clean and free.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  If you have been baptized
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In Jesus holy name,
\par the Lord your maker will save you
\par and forgive all your sins.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     4.  Today, you believe Christ
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj      and give your self to Him.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj  He brings you to the fold of His
\par  children and follow you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  May you all follow Him,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  Look for things from Heaven:
\par  That's where your Heavenly Father
\par \pard       Will make a perfect home.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

